|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

===Other===
* [[Strongbox]]es with the {{ml|ChestPoisonCloud}} prefix
* The caustic bomb thrown by [[Undying Alchemist]]s
* Certain [[zombie]]s, which release caustic ground on death
* Monsters with the Toxic archnemesis mod, whose on-death orbs create caustic ground when they drop
* [[Infested Ursa]] and [[Vivid Weta]] release caustic ground on death
* Skill used by [[Ryslatha, the Puppet Mistress]]
* [[The Temple of Atzoatl]] with "poison themed" rooms such as [[Toxic Grove]]. Clusters of plants are randomly spread throughout the whole area, which release a '''Caustic Ground''' once stepped on. The amount of plants is determined by the respective room level (with higher room levels adding more plants).
*Heist monsters (in [[Prohibited Library]] tileset for example), lay Caustic ground with yellow status icon
* [[Conjuror of Rot]] spectres greater than Imperfect will drop Caustic ground

